  "description": "Seedance 2.5 is ByteDance's higher-end multimodal video generation model for production-oriented creative work. It supports native 30-second video generation, larger reference sets across image, video, and audio inputs, and stronger instruction following for complex shots, multilingual prompts, and reference-heavy creative direction. It is especially well suited to branded storytelling, advertising, explainers, and other commercial workflows that need longer continuous scenes, tighter subject and style consistency, and precise edits that preserve the rest of the shot.",
